-- The cast after EVERY must be a constructor of the PARTY type. `Sign` builds
-- an Action, so the contract is not a DEONTIC Actor Action.

DECLARE Actor IS ONE OF
    Tenant HAS name IS A STRING

DECLARE Action IS ONE OF
    Sign HAS signer IS AN Actor

GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
bad MEANS
    EVERY Sign s MUST Sign (EXACTLY s) WITHIN 14
